## conditional forecasting {background-color="#FFD800"}

- forecast labour markets given the future path of $gdp$

```{r}
#| label: forpolcond
#| cache: true
#| warning: false
#| output-location: slide

post |>
  forecast(
    horizon = 3,
    exogenous_forecast = ilo_exogenous_forecasts,
    conditional_forecast = ilo_conditional_forecasts[c_select]
  ) |> 
  plot(which_c = "UKR", main = "Conditional forecasts for Ukraine")
```













